You can troubleshoot:

getent hosts appserver

If it fails, check:

cat /etc/resolv.conf

Then:

resolvectl status

Then:

dig appserver

Then check network connectivity.

=> Simple troubleshooting flow

Hostname not working
        ↓
Can the name resolve?
        ↓
getent hosts appserver
        ↓
If no → Check DNS configuration
        ↓
If yes → Check network/service
